# sound_hurt: when the local player's health drops, the client plays the hurt
# grunt (SFX_HURT) as it applies the server's PKT_PLAYER_HEALTH. Driven entirely
# through the authoritative health path (no physics/reach race). set_health is
# sent twice with steps between: the first can no-op if the client isn't fully
# active yet under load, so the second guarantees the drop lands. The client
# fires SFX_HURT in client_poll when it sees health fall, so a nonzero hurt count
# is proof the drop reached the client. Counters start at zero each run.
> {"cmd":"step","ticks":15}
# Player spawns at full health; no hurt yet.
expect health == 20
expect sounds.hurt == 0
> {"cmd":"set_health","value":6}
> {"cmd":"step","ticks":3}
> {"cmd":"set_health","value":6}
> {"cmd":"step","ticks":12}
# Health dropped -> the hurt grunt fired.
expect health == 6
expect sounds.hurt > 0
